A name is ASCII, so a word with a letter outside ASCII in it is text.

Not elements: @aé(1) @a-é(1) @a_é(1) @名前(1) @é(1).

Not calls: $aé(1) $a-é(1) $a.é(1) $名前(1).

Not boxes: \<?aé> \<?a-é> \<?名前>.

Elements: @a-e[]{ value: "1" } and @a_e[]{ value: "1" }.

Calls: `$a-e(1)` and `$a.e(1)`.

Boxes: `<?a-e>` and `<?a>`.
